  "statuteText": "259:84-a Recreation Vehicle. –\n\n\"Recreation vehicle\" shall mean a self-propelled or towed vehicle that is equipped to serve as temporary living quarters for recreational, camping, or travel purposes and is used solely as a family or personal conveyance."
